{"description": "<p style=\"margin-top:0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Overview:&nbsp;</b></span></span><span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Our client is a well-established company operating within the manufacturing and distribution industry, serving a diverse regional customer base. Due to continued regional expansion, they are seeking an experienced and results-driven </span></span><span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Finance Manager</b></span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><b> </b>to join their Guyana-based team. The successful candidate will provide financial leadership, oversee key financial operations and support the organisation's continued growth and compliance objectives.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px\"><b><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></b><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Duties & Responsibilities:</b></span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Lead\n     the preparation of financial reports, plans, forecasts, budgets,\n     reconciliation, audits and taxation to ensure alignment with strategic\n     objectives.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Monitor\n     cash flow, expenses, revenues and financial\n     performance.&nbsp;&nbsp;Implement financial management procedures and\n     controls.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Conduct\n     risk management and competitive analysis.&nbsp;&nbsp;Advise on potential\n     financial risks and provide recommendations.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Ensure\n     compliance with financial laws and regulations.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Manage\n     investments and capital activities. Identify cost reduction and analyze\n     trends.</span></span></span><br></li></ul><div><br></div><br><h3>Requirements</h3><div><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">A\n     bachelor’s degree in accounting / finance / business with at least 5\n     years’ experience in a Finance leadership role; OR completion of ACCA or\n     similar accounting designation with 4 years’ experience in a Finance\n     leadership role.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Proficient\n     in accounting systems, with specific experience in SAGE and/or similar ERP\n     and accounting systems. Experience with SAGE Intacct would be an\n     advantage.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Strong\n     knowledge of International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS) for SMEs.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Excellent\n     analytical skills with a strategic mindset.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">A\n     proactive approach to problem solving.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">High\n     level of interpersonal, communication and leadership skills across a\n     diverse community.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Sound\n     knowledge of MS Office suite, especially in Excel and PowerPoint.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Detail-oriented,\n     with a readiness to Champion best practices.</span></span></span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></span></li><li style=\"\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family:Calibri, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size:16px\">Open\n     to learning, adaptability, and innovation with a growth mindset.</span></span></span><br></li></ul></div><br>", "salary": "", "remote": false, "nivel": "Senior (5-10 ani)", "limbi": []}